OL,3,GNEWSADrink-driver guilty of road rage
OL,4,Acyclist murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FMorgan, of George Winter Court,
OL,7,FNorwich, had denied the offence during
OL,8,Fa trial at Norwich Crown Court,
OL,9,Fclaiming he just wanted to annoy Smith,
OL,10,Fbut "misjudged" his timing when he
OL,11,Fswerved towards him.
